#~ msgid ""
#~ "Xfce release notes are specific to each version. Select your version from "
#~ "the list below to see the changes in the release. "
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Xfce 发行日志针对各个版本。从以下列表中选择您的版本即可查看其中的更改。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "{{ .s1 }}Download the Xfce artwork tarball{{ .s2 }}. It contains some "
#~ "high-quality logos and banners. Copying of the Xfce logo is subject to "
#~ "the LGPL copyright license."
